    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "widgets_values": [
        "## ACE-Step 1.5 Edit Workflow\n\nUnified workflow for extend and/or repaint operations.\n\n**Extend:** Add content before/after audio\n- Set extend_left_seconds and/or extend_right_seconds > 0\n\n**Repaint:** Regenerate a section\n- Set repaint_start_seconds >= 0 and repaint_end_seconds > start\n\n**Both:** Combine extend and repaint in one pass\n\n**Model:**\n- [ace_step_1.5_turbo_aio.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ace_step_1.5_ComfyUI_files/resolve/main/checkpoints/ace_step_1.5_turbo_aio.safetensors)\n\n## [gimmi stars on github](https://github.com/ryanontheinside/ComfyUI_RyanOnTheInside)\n\n## [follow me on youtube](https://www.youtube.com/@ryanontheinside)\n"
      ],
